{
 "duration": 43.355,
 "voice": "am_puck",
 "speed": 0.9,
 "lines": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "text": "One tiny splash was all it took",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 2.04
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "text": "to send Ellie running!",
   "start": 2.1,
   "end": 3.237
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "text": "Ellie was the tiniest elephant in the jungle,",
   "start": 3.457,
   "end": 5.867
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "text": "and she hated getting wet.",
   "start": 6.087,
   "end": 7.475
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "text": "While her friends splashed happily in the river,",
   "start": 7.695,
   "end": 9.865
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "text": "Ellie watched alone from the dry grass.",
   "start": 10.045,
   "end": 12.248
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "text": "Suddenly, a little yellow bird",
   "start": 12.488,
   "end": 14.448
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "text": "slipped off a branch and fell into the water!",
   "start": 14.508,
   "end": 16.433
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "text": "He chirped and fluttered in panic,",
   "start": 16.633,
   "end": 18.163
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "text": "too small to swim back alone.",
   "start": 18.423,
   "end": 20.202
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "text": "Ellie's heart pounded fast.",
   "start": 20.442,
   "end": 21.855
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "text": "The river looked cold and scary,",
   "start": 22.055,
   "end": 23.855
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "text": "but her new friend needed help.",
   "start": 23.975,
   "end": 25.466
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "text": "Taking one deep breath, she stepped in",
   "start": 25.706,
   "end": 27.436
  },
  {
   "i": 14,
   "text": "and waded carefully toward him.",
   "start": 27.516,
   "end": 29.514
  },
  {
   "i": 15,
   "text": "With one gentle scoop of her trunk, she lifted him safely,",
   "start": 29.754,
   "end": 33.154
  },
  {
   "i": 16,
   "text": "and all her jungle friends cheered!",
   "start": 33.244,
   "end": 35.234
  },
  {
   "i": 17,
   "text": "Ellie smiled, knowing that being brave means trying,",
   "start": 35.494,
   "end": 38.584
  },
  {
   "i": 18,
   "text": "even when you're scared! Subscribe to Kidolu!",
   "start": 38.664,
   "end": 41.305
  }
 ]
}